{"prefectureId":"37","cities":{"37201":[{"id":"37201:national:573cb029f018","cityId":"37201","category":"文化・名所","text":"「石清尾山古墳群」は国指定の史跡です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/2511"},{"id":"37201:national:1e073e09a72b","cityId":"37201","category":"地理・自然","text":"市域の西部は香東川の土砂が堆積してできた扇状地から成っています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%AB%98%E6%9D%BE%E5%B8%82&oldid=111015635"},{"id":"37201:national:602af8084109","cityId":"37201","category":"地理・自然","text":"市内の難読地名としては中間町、亀水町、小村町、浦生、弓弦羽などがあります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%AB%98%E6%9D%BE%E5%B8%82&oldid=111015635"},{"id":"37201:national:1e145c799d64","cityId":"37201","category":"地域","text":"高松市は、香川県の中部に位置する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%AB%98%E6%9D%BE%E5%B8%82&oldid=111015635"}],"37202":[{"id":"37202:national:1a31dad5ce74","cityId":"37202","category":"地理・自然","text":"丸亀市は瀬戸内海に面し、丸亀平野の北東部と塩飽諸島の一部を市域としています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E4%B8%B8%E4%BA%80%E5%B8%82&oldid=111356566"}],"37203":[{"id":"37203:national:d40959da69e7","cityId":"37203","category":"地域","text":"坂出市は、香川県の中央部に位置する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%9D%82%E5%87%BA%E5%B8%82&oldid=111035585"}],"37204":[{"id":"37204:national:696ea7bce651","cityId":"37204","category":"文化・名所","text":"「天霧城跡」は国指定の史跡です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/2528"},{"id":"37204:national:59d7f919425d","cityId":"37204","category":"文化・名所","text":"「有岡古墳群」は国指定の史跡です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/2527"},{"id":"37204:national:8efe2fba3784","cityId":"37204","category":"歴史","text":"市内には戦国時代、西讃地域を支配していた香川氏の居城天霧城があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%96%84%E9%80%9A%E5%AF%BA%E5%B8%82&oldid=111420542"},{"id":"37204:national:97f193d046d4","cityId":"37204","category":"歴史","text":"善通寺市の大部分は旧丸亀藩領です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%96%84%