696ea7bce651","cityId":"37208","category":"文化・名所","text":"「天霧城跡」は国指定の史跡です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/2528"},{"id":"37208:national:ae9fe53f044d","cityId":"37208","category":"文化・名所","text":"三豊市の主な商業施設としてゆめタウン三豊があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E4%B8%89%E8%B1%8A%E5%B8%82&oldid=111138444"},{"id":"37208:national:c3f73c632cb2","cityId":"37208","category":"地理・自然","text":"市域は香川県を南北に縦断する。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E4%B8%89%E8%B1%8A%E5%B8%82&oldid=111138444"},{"id":"37208:national:387634401dbf","cityId":"37208","category":"地理・自然","text":"三豊市には紫雲出山があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E4%B8%89%E8%B1%8A%E5%B8%82&oldid=111138444"}],"37322":[{"id":"37322:national:df9c6ffb566e","cityId":"37322","category":"文化・名所","text":"土庄町役場では土渕海峡の横断証明書を発行しています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%9C%9F%E5%BA%84%E7%94%BA&oldid=111144012"},{"id":"37322:national:43115b3bd454","cityId":"37322","category":"地域","text":"土庄町は、香川県小豆郡に属する町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%9C%9F%E5%BA%84%E7%94%BA&oldid=111144012"}],"37324":[{"id":"37324:national:4ca56ad5dbce","cityId":"37324","category":"文化・名所","text":"「皇子神社社叢」は国指定の天然記念物です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/2507"},{"id":"37324:national:2b2e5be33fc5","cityId":"37324","category":"地域","text":"小豆島町は、香川県の小豆郡に属する町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%B0%8F%E8%B1%86%E5%B3%B6%E7%94%BA&oldid=111139885"}],"37341":[{"id":"37341:national:804dc00b8950","cityId":"37341","category":"地理・自然","text":"三木町には立石山があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E4%B8%89%E6%9C%A8%E7%94%BA&oldid=110790338"},{"id":"37341:national:7ac31e98b68e","cityId":"37341","category":"地域","text":"三木町は、香川県の東部（東讃）に位置する町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E4%B8%89%E6%9C%A8%E7%94%BA&oldid=110790338"}],"37364":[{"id":"37364:national:164ca2a39ff0","